--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DESIGN DECISIONS & NOTES FOR REVIEWERS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  1. NEVER RAISE policy
     Both tools wrap the entire body in `except Exception`. This is intentional
     per spec. The agent pipeline must never crash due to a geocoder or news
     API being down. Sentinel values allow agents to degrade gracefully.

  2. No RunContextWrapper needed
     The tools read credentials from `settings` (Pydantic BaseSettings singleton)
     rather than a runtime DB session or injected context. This is the correct
     pattern when the only shared resource is a config object.

  3. @function_tool auto-generates JSON schema
     The OpenAI Agents SDK reads the function signature + Args: docstring to
     produce the JSON schema shown to the LLM. Types float/str are mapped to
     number/string. No manual schema definition required.

  4. list return type on search_local_news
     SDK serialises Python lists to JSON arrays automatically. Each dict item
     {title, snippet, link} maps to a JSON object the LLM can read naturally.

  5. Agents already registered (Abdullah's work — untouched)
     signal_agent.tools       = [reverse_geocode, ...]
     detection_agent.tools     = [search_local_news, ...]
     verification_agent.tools  = [search_local_news, ...]
     These registrations in agent_definitions.py are correct and were NOT
     modified. Uneeza's scope is the tool implementations only.

